# The spelled hook of GludioKnight (35235): a good skill of the character landing on the
# knight, Might (1068), leaves it alone; only Seal of Ruler (246) would make it attack. The
# shipped Seal of Ruler targets a holy artifact alone (target HOLY), so it never lands on a
# guard: tests/ai/siege_guard_test.go covers that branch with a fixture skill.
character Hunter 20
skill 1068 1
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioHold
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioKnight
npc knight 35235 SiegeGuard 100 0 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300

cast knight 1068
  S MagicSkillUse caster=player target=knight skill=1068-1 hit=10015 reuse=15022 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=46 4:1068,1
  hate knight 0
  desires knight -
